  },
  {
    "id": "v2-065",
    "language": "zh",
    "kind": "reference",
    "text": "請看啟示錄第十三章第三節",
    "target": [
      66,
      13,
      3
    ],
    "split": "fresh",
    "voice": "Eddy (Chinese (Taiwan))",
    "rate": 175,
    "sha256": "8fb977379041074f76e37c76c2c8a374172fdd0cf41290221f1b0aaf2cf1e6d9",
    "duration_s": 2.8946875
  },
  {
    "id": "v2-066",
    "language": "zh",
    "kind": "quotation",
    "text": "衆民聽說王爲他兒子憂愁，他們得勝的歡樂卻變成悲哀。",
    "target": [
      10,
      19,
      2
    ],
    "split": "fresh",
    "voice": "Meijia",
    "rate": 175,
    "sha256": "dc68fc5d8be4eb165c73bcd5ab4fc73ef06722ee99b7438b74f0c4857f3843c6",
    "duration_s": 5.525
  },
  {
    "id": "v2-067",
    "language": "zh",
    "kind": "quotation",
    "text": "但現在的天地還是憑着那命存留，直留到不敬虔之人受審判遭沉淪的日子，用火焚燒。",
    "target": [
      61,
      3,
      7
    ],
    "split": "fresh",
    "voice": "Eddy (Chinese (Taiwan))",
    "rate": 175,
    "sha256": "206181b735552cf73063026779b30e43bcf97c24c14efbc6eb53d58a20d3aa47",
    "duration_s": 7.7741875
  },
  {
    "id": "v2-068",
    "language": "zh",
    "kind": "quotation",
    "text": "人子來了，也喫也喝，人又說他是貪食好酒的人，是稅吏和罪人的朋友。但智慧之子總以智慧爲是 。」",
    "target": [
      40,
      11,
      19
    ],
    "split": "fresh",
    "voice": "Meijia",
    "rate": 175,
    "sha256": "92696102722e72cfc2d9262c450f66cf7b9feb4e79eb1f8d95f105ddc8dd9da9",
    "duration_s": 9.783625
  },
  {
    "id": "v2-069",
    "language": "zh",
    "kind": "quotation",
    "text": "你們既聽見真理的道，就是那叫你們得救的福音，也信了基督，既然信他，就受了所應許的聖靈爲印記。",
    "target": [
      49,
      1,
      13
    ],
    "split": "fresh",
    "voice": "Eddy (Chinese (Taiwan))",
    "rate": 175,
    "sha256": "f83f60b99bcc5dcf9783675c4fe65ac87e7008bfdddf8b4b623870f6e99d1fad",
    "duration_s": 8.8205625
  },
  {
    "id": "v2-070",
    "language": "zh",
    "kind": "quotation",
    "text": "我還有末了的話：你們要靠着主，倚賴他的大能大力作剛強的人。",
    "target": [
      49,
      6,
      8
    ],
    "split": "fresh",
    "voice": "Meijia",
    "rate": 175,
    "sha256": "c45b41610d159aa954928b487da32cb3f930a6702bf07aae27998965b6b6fd9e",
    "duration_s": 6.0911875
  },
  {
    "id": "v2-071",
    "language": "zh",
    "kind": "quotation",
    "text": "在他離俗歸耶和華的一切日子，不可挨近死屍。",
    "target": [
      4,
      6,
      6
    ],
    "split": "fresh",
    "voice": "Eddy (Chinese (Taiwan))",
    "rate": 175,
    "sha256": "bea4ca2800b50984a762f5a228d14a741d9774ee43ef3ecf42bd2b5785b692c4",
    "duration_s": 4.132
  },
  {
    "id": "v2-072",
    "language": "zh",
    "kind": "quotation",
    "text": "呂便聽見了，要救他脫離他們的手，說：「我們不可害他的性命」；",
    "target": [
      1,
      37,
      21
    ],
    "split": "fresh",
    "voice": "Meijia",
    "rate": 175,
    "sha256": "e9cb5c346d0d441dab8544bf9f27e3d167e7d3d7f3153db87ea90b785a627313",
    "duration_s": 6.1376875
  },
  {
    "id": "v2-073",
    "language": "zh",
    "kind": "quotation",
    "text": "但如今，在這裏再沒有可傳的地方，而且這好幾年，我切心想望到西班牙去的時候，可以到你們那裏，",
    "target": [
      45,
      15,
      23
    ],
    "split": "fresh",
    "voice": "Eddy (Chinese (Taiwan))",
    "rate": 175,
    "sha256": "7d2c2d524f276338eea67f6649a2e7278c20f269e162e0a304ebcfcdbbd31263",
    "duration_s": 8.1210625
  },
  {
    "id": "v2-074",
    "language": "zh",
    "kind": "quotation",
    "text": "你向黎巴嫩行強暴與殘害 驚嚇野獸的事必遮蓋你； 因你殺人流血， 向國內的城並城中一切居民施行強暴。",
    "target": [
      35,
      2,
      17
    ],
    "split": "fresh",
    "voice": "Meijia",
    "rate": 175,
    "sha256": "88f564afccab3c79402a6760083533a9e1149b02f632414f88f05a0f8e2ff73d",
    "duration_s": 10.4683125
  },
  {
    "id": "v2-075",
    "language": "zh",
    "kind": "quotation",
    "text": "從除掉常獻的燔祭，並設立那行毀壞可憎之物的時候，必有一千二百九十日。",
    "target": [
      27,
      12,
      11
    ],
    "split": "fresh",
    "voice": "Eddy (Chinese (Taiwan))",
    "rate": 175,
    "sha256": "ffcd558fff59d08c6fbb8257ceaf2f8da554729d13ff13b5e0434351268b9cc6",
    "duration_s": 6.8145
  },
  {
    "id": "v2-076",
    "language": "zh",
    "kind": "quotation",
    "text": "到了每西亞的邊界，他們想要往庇推尼去，耶穌的靈卻不許。",
    "target": [
      44,
      16,
      7
    ],
    "split": "fresh",
    "voice": "Meijia",
    "rate": 175,
    "sha256": "aaf00a19c4a9e5d840a5e9026384c186f9450a42473b7f0e65a9101aefa1bedb",
    "duration_s": 5.6983125
  },
  {
    "id": "v2-077",
    "language": "zh",
    "kind": "quotation",
    "text": "你要趕緊給律師西納和亞波羅送行，叫他們沒有缺乏。",
    "target": [
      56,
      3,
      13
    ],
    "split": "fresh",
    "voice": "Eddy (Chinese (Taiwan))",
    "rate": 175,
    "sha256": "b74059094cbaf00333f6b0858c4f4b2c9dae22f243458d8893934b107dbbb141",
    "duration_s": 4.8199375
  },
  {
    "id": "v2-078",
    "language": "zh",
    "kind": "quotation",
    "text": "「你們這假冒爲善的文士和法利賽人有禍了！因爲你們走遍洋海陸地，勾引一個人入教，既入了教，卻使他作地獄之子，比你們還加倍。",
    "target": [
      40,
      23,
      14
    ],
    "split": "fresh",
    "voice": "Meijia",
    "rate": 175,
    "sha256": "e749d6b2c3eedd79c9b9d2eb5289ef680fc5c6ee2ac410bbb7daec6c3d4d6ee7",
    "duration_s": 12.639375
  },
  {
    "id": "v2-079",
    "language": "zh",
    "kind": "quotation",
    "text": "我必顯爲大，顯爲聖，在多國人的眼前顯現；他們就知道我是耶和華。」",
    "target": [
      26,
      38,
      23
    ],
    "split": "fresh",
    "voice": "Eddy (Chinese (Taiwan))",
    "rate": 175,
    "sha256": "15e7d02e28e28eca1b241403132b281e3fdf5542ff3d25358ca52d8b1a798cd5",
    "duration_s": 6.034
  },
  {
    "id": "v2-080",
    "language": "zh",
    "kind": "quotation",
    "text": "耶和華必伸手攻擊北方，毀滅亞述， 使尼尼微荒涼，又幹旱如曠野。",
    "target": [
      36,
      2,
      12
    ],
    "split": "fresh",
    "voice": "Meijia",
    "rate": 175,
    "sha256": "7327a596dd6365eb8d47d5932e364a74d28331aa800d3f9d649d4e3dd07ca0d2",
    "duration_s": 7.1823125
  },
  {
    "id": "v2-081",
    "language": "zh",
    "kind": "quotation",
    "text": "我命乾旱臨到地土、山岡、五穀、新酒，和油，並地上的出產、人民、牲畜，以及人手一切勞碌得來的。」",
    "target": [
      37,
      1,
      11
    ],
    "split": "fresh",
    "voice": "Eddy (Chinese (Taiwan))",
    "rate": 175,
    "sha256": "ffc7d32689415e9169f5ede347e4cccbbc9cf9e99e13f69b334b0097f2b3813d",
    "duration_s": 8.924625
  },
  {
    "id": "v2-082",
    "language": "zh",
    "kind": "quotation",
    "text": "出於 神的，必聽 神的話；你們不聽，因爲你們不是出於 神。」",
    "target": [
      43,
      8,
      47
    ],
    "split": "fresh",
    "voice": "Meijia",
    "rate": 175,
    "sha256": "f0a48cc0ec08c593af205ef988d5038427632282243326c92545b98b97e98ef8",
    "duration_s": 5.68075
  },
  {
    "id": "v2-083",
    "language": "zh",
    "kind": "quotation",
    "text": "在外有刀劍；在內有瘟疫、饑荒。在田野的，必遭刀劍而死；在城中的，必有饑荒、瘟疫吞滅他。",
    "target": [
      26,
      7,
      15
    ],
    "split": "fresh",
    "voice": "Eddy (Chinese (Taiwan))",
    "rate": 175,
    "sha256": "a516f81574131a18c71014d2087be252a22800925c5ac269bcec9af1f27b49db",
    "duration_s": 8.5835625
  },
  {
    "id": "v2-084",
    "language": "zh",
    "kind": "quotation",
    "text": "和妹子亞腓亞並與我們同當兵的亞基布，以及在你家的教會。",
    "target": [
      57,
      1,
      2
    ],
    "split": "fresh",
    "voice": "Meijia",
    "rate": 175,
    "sha256": "0df00b8ed641afca810326c9a086a00dc7c9f574ef9a47f924fa6357df497dd0",
    "duration_s": 5.3776875
  },
  {
    "id": "v2-085",
    "language": "zh",
    "kind": "quotation",
    "text": "如今就當辦成這事。既有願做的心，也當照你們所有的去辦成。",
    "target": [
      47,
      8,
      11
    ],
    "split": "fresh",
